Special Lecture at Anand International College
Guidance given on career opportunities in computer science field
Jaipur @ Patrika Plus A lecture was organized under the 'Bridging Industry and Academia' series for Computer Science students by the Innovation Council of Anand International College of Engineering.
Vivek Mishra, associate software engineer of a US company, served as the keynote speaker. Gave guidance to students on career opportunities and emerging technologies in Computer Science field. He discussed in detail the importance of computer science and its implications. College Vice Chairperson Monica Mittal Aggarwal, Principal Prof. (Dr.) Vijay Kumar Sharma and Vice Principal Prof. Dr. Praveen Aggarwal was present.
